  "question": {
    "text": "<p>If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#947;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#960;</mi><mo>,</mo></math>&nbsp;then the system of equations</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mi>&#947;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mi>&#946;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mi>&#947;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mi>&#945;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mi>&#946;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mi>&#945;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>has :</p>",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
